WEBVTT

00:09:59.261 --> 00:10:01.639
Now that I'm released,
I have my voice back,

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:05.434
and, mercifully, it puts me in a position
where I can advocate

00:10:05.476 --> 00:10:07.936
for that little boy
with the Statue of Liberty patch

00:10:07.978 --> 00:10:09.980
on his UNHCR-donated jeans,

00:10:10.022 --> 00:10:11.815
chasing the American dream.

00:10:12.441 --> 00:10:13.817
I hope you'll join me.

00:10:13.859 --> 00:10:20.866
(Applause)